      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. the dialogue feels heavy, which is what i need. can you expand on this? maybe have them talk more about the \"threat\" they feel it poses to their way of life or their community's values. i want to really lean into that sense of resentment and how they justify their views to each other. make it feel like they truly believe they are the ones being wronged here.",
